          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo daaha waa inaad u samaysaa shan tiir oo qudhac ah, oo dahab ku dahaadh iyaga, qabsatooyinkooduna ha ahaadeen dahab; oo waa inaad shan saldhig oo naxaas ah u yeeshaa.",
          "type": "text",
